Subject: This week: prompt injection in email assistants
List-Unsubscribe: <https://security-weekly.example/unsubscribe>

This week's issue looks at prompt injection. Attackers hide sentences such as "ignore all
previous instructions" in emails, hoping that an AI assistant summarising the inbox will obey
them. Our guest explains how mail providers test their assistants against it.

Read the full issue at https://security-weekly.example/issues/212
